<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 160 0 R
/T (Hospital readmission performance is shaped by overall organizational quality not by any single lever like patient satisfaction, ownership type, or ER availability in isolation. CMS overall rating and readmission-specific quality measures are the clearest, statistically robust predictors, together explaining about a third of the variation across 3,000+ hospitals.)
/E (Hospital readmission performance is shaped by overall organizational quality not by any single lever like patient satisfaction, ownership type, or ER availability in isolation. CMS overall rating and readmission-specific quality measures are the clearest, statistically robust predictors, together explaining about a third of the variation across 3,000+ hospitals.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
